@startuml itqan-act-01a-session-start
' Itqan — Activity Diagram 01a: Recitation session, start
' Built only from Itqan_Requirements.md: UC-10 flow steps 1-3 and its
' exceptions (§7.3), includes UC-08 and UC-09 (§7.2); FR-05, FR-07, FR-11,
' FR-27; BR-07, BR-16. Continues in 01b at connector A.
<style>
root {
  FontName Helvetica
  FontSize 12
  FontColor #000000
  BackGroundColor #FFFFFF
  LineColor #000000
  LineThickness 0.75
  RoundCorner 0
  Shadowing 0
}

note { BackGroundColor #FFFFFF; LineColor #000000; FontColor #000000 }

activityDiagram {
  activity    { BackGroundColor #FFFFFF; LineColor #000000; FontColor #000000; RoundCorner 10 }
  diamond     { BackGroundColor #FFFFFF; LineColor #000000 }
  activityBar { BackGroundColor #000000; LineColor #000000 }
  arrow       { LineColor #000000; LineThickness 0.75 }
  swimlane    { LineColor #000000; LineThickness 0.75 }
}
</style>

|Quran Reader|
start
:Select surah (UC-08);
:Select AI mode (UC-09);
note right
  Surah and mode are fixed
  for the session (BR-07)
end note

|Itqan System|
if (Recitation consent recorded?) then (no)
  |Quran Reader|
  if (Grant recitation consent? (UC-05)) then (no)
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
  |Itqan System|
  :Record recitation consent;
else (yes)
endif

if (Microphone permission granted?) then (no)
  :Explain how to grant permission;
  stop
else (yes)
endif

:Start session and show verses;
(A)
note right: Continues in Activity Diagram 01b
detach

@enduml
